==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Hinox Teeth are [[Monster Part]]s dropped by [[Hinox]]es and [[Stalnox]] upon their defeats. Like other Monster Parts, they can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used as an ingredient for Brown [[Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] or exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]].

The [[Fierce Deity Set]] requires Hinox Teeth in order to be upgraded to its second tier at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
